<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="960" height="440" viewBox="0 0 960 440" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc">
  <title id="title">Named model: persist, project, reconcile</title>
  <desc id="desc">Three stages: persist normalized activity events, project UI counts from that store only, reconcile with Foundry and App Insights via correlation ids.</desc>
  <rect width="960" height="440" fill="#f8fafc"/>
  <defs>
    <marker id="arrowNavy" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#0369a1"/>
    </marker>
  </defs>
  <text x="480" y="34" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="#0c4a6e">Named model: persist → project → reconcile</text>
  <text x="480" y="56" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#0369a1">events are the system of record · chips are projections · traces must match</text>

  <rect x="36" y="88" width="270" height="200" rx="16" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#0ea5e9" stroke-width="2"/>
  <circle cx="66" cy="118" r="14" fill="#e0f2fe" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <text x="66" y="123" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#0c4a6e">1</text>
  <text x="171" y="124" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#0c4a6e">Persist</text>
  <text x="171" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#0369a1">normalized events</text>
  <text x="171" y="186" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#64748b">per session turn</text>
  <text x="171" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#64748b">tool · status · latency</text>
  <text x="171" y="250" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#0284c7">not chat bubbles alone</text>

  <line x1="318" y1="188" x2="352" y2="188" stroke="#0369a1" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arrowNavy)"/>

  <rect x="360" y="88" width="270" height="200" rx="16" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="2"/>
  <circle cx="390" cy="118" r="14" fill="#bae6fd" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <text x="390" y="123" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#0c4a6e">2</text>
  <text x="495" y="124" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#0c4a6e">Project</text>
  <text x="495" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#0369a1">UI chips and counts</text>
  <text x="495" y="186" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#64748b">from the event store</text>
  <text x="495" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#64748b">never spinner increments</text>
  <text x="495" y="250" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#0284c7">simplify, do not invent</text>

  <line x1="642" y1="188" x2="676" y2="188" stroke="#0369a1" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arrowNavy)"/>

  <rect x="684" y="88" width="240" height="200" rx="16" fill="#0ea5e9"/>
  <circle cx="714" cy="118" r="14" fill="#0284c7"/>
  <text x="714" y="123" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff">3</text>
  <text x="804" y="124" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff">Reconcile</text>
  <text x="804" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#e0f2fe">Foundry + App Insights</text>
  <text x="804" y="186" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#bae6fd">same correlation ids</text>
  <text x="804" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#bae6fd">tests catch drift</text>
  <text x="804" y="250" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#ffffff">one story for support</text>

  <rect x="36" y="322" width="888" height="88" rx="14" fill="#e0f2fe" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <text x="480" y="358" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#0c4a6e">If you cannot explain the tool calls, you have a chat skin</text>
  <text x="480" y="386" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#0369a1">Persist the timeline. Project the chips. Reconcile with platform traces.</text>
</svg>
